&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;NuGet: &lt;a href="https://www.nuget.org/packages/OpenTelemetry.PersistentStorage.Abstractions/1.0.3" rel="nofollow"&gt;OpenTelemetry.PersistentStorage.Abstractions v1.0.3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No notable changes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;See &lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/blob/PersistentStorage-1.0.3/src/OpenTelemetry.PersistentStorage.Abstractions/CHANGELOG.md"&gt;CHANGELOG&lt;/a&gt; for details.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;NuGet: &lt;a href="https://www.nuget.org/packages/OpenTelemetry.PersistentStorage.FileSystem/1.0.3" rel="nofollow"&gt;OpenTelemetry.PersistentStorage.FileSystem v1.0.3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed an issue in persistent storage cleanup where malformed &lt;code&gt;.blob&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;.tmp&lt;/code&gt;,&lt;br&gt;
or &lt;code&gt;.lock&lt;/code&gt; filenames could throw and interrupt maintenance.&lt;br&gt;
&lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/4159" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/4159/hovercard"&gt;#4159&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
